{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drifters Don't Brake: Midnight</strong> is a Top-down Arcade Racer where the car is always accelerating and you must navigate through different terrains by <i>drifting</i>. How many attempts will you need in order to beat all the challenging levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/driving.gif?t=1748999865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Brakes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no brake mechanic in the game, you'll have to think fast and drift your way through the levels. Any mistake might ruin your run.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 Attempts</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your headlights may get defective and stop working if the car hits a wall 1 or 2 times. The third wall-hit will  cause the car to break and you'll be required to restart the current level.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied Terrains</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to adapt your drifting techniques to drive over different terrains. The terrains can cause the car to drift more or less, as well as interfere on the car speed or controls</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/Animation2.gif?t=1748999865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Car Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the car shape, color, window color, and decals to create a more personalized design.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show everyone how fast you can be on different levels of the game.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Map Editor</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and share maps with the community</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/car_editor.gif?t=1748999865\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491670?t=1748999865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/70d06c0a7a0754138821de3aa287c60fc301812f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748999865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/b54580ca2f062c3e1f2dfd67509f36462357d25e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748999865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/b54580ca2f062c3e1f2dfd67509f36462357d25e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748999865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drifters Don't Brake: Midnight</strong> is a Top-down Arcade Racer where the car is always accelerating and you must navigate through different terrains by <i>drifting</i>. How many attempts will you need in order to beat all the challenging levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491670/extras/driving.gif?t=1748999865\" /></p><p cl